{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792267680, "covers_from": "2026-10-17T20:08:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-17T20:09:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792267740, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-17T20:08:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 18890, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "大安區老鼠多到白天都不怕人，還大喇喇的過馬路，因為很多小吃店環境衛生很嚴重，希望市長要好好勸導。", "display_name": "大安代表 燕 燕", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T20:08:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3959, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "給比市長更像個市長的伯洋，很多路口的紅燈號誌秒數超過60秒，夏天很曬對機車族很不友善也更容易發生事故", "display_name": "萬華代表 Amy 曉君", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T20:08:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 42705, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "北捷拆掉座椅没有配套措施，要增加扶手並且要考慮身高嬌小的人能否拉得到。", "display_name": "大同代表 No.42,705", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T20:08:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 19, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 7976, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "觀光", "content": "大家對內湖的印象就是內湖科學園區 但內湖有很多步道 除了平日的上班族 也引進一些觀光客來內湖消費吧", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.7,976", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 3959, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 Amy 曉君", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 42705, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.42,705", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 7976, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.7,976", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 49657, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name":